{\rtf1\ansi\deff0 {\fonttbl {\f0 Aptos;}{\f1 Courier New;}}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa180\b\f0\fs34\cf1 PTMT Stage A — Read-only closure checks\b0\par\pard\sa100\f0\fs19 Date: 7 September 2026\par\pard\sa100\f0\fs19 Stage A is complete. The gate does not pass, so Stage B was not run. No overrides were changed and no plan was created.\par\pard\sa100\b\f0\fs25\cf2 A1. Input totals for development run #2410\b0\par\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\cellx7200\intbl\b\fs16 Input\b0\cell\intbl\b\fs16 App value\b0\cell\intbl\b\fs16 Expected\b0\cell\intbl\b\fs16 Difference\b0\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\cellx7200\intbl\fs16 3-month average input total\cell\intbl\fs16 767,219.25\cell\intbl\fs16 Category-dependent\cell\intbl\fs16 —\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\cellx7200\intbl\fs16 Stock\cell\intbl\fs16 477,066\cell\intbl\fs16 481,718\cell\intbl\fs16 -4,652\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\cellx7200\intbl\fs16 Pending order\cell\intbl\fs16 6,330\cell\intbl\fs16 5,912\cell\intbl\fs16 +418\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\cellx7200\intbl\fs16 Pending order last month / dummy\cell\intbl\fs16 190,367\cell\intbl\fs16 158,229\cell\intbl\fs16 +32,138\cell\row\pard\sa80\par\pard\sa100\f0\fs19 The current-pending difference is within the stated tolerance range. The last-month-pending difference is not: it is approximately 32,000 pieces higher than the expected source total. Because the first three input checks do not reconcile, the multiplier comparison should not proceed yet.\par\pard\sa100\b\f0\fs25\cf2 A2. Input totals by category\b0\par\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\cellx7200\cellx9000\intbl\b\fs16 Category\b0\cell\intbl\b\fs16 Avg-3-month input\b0\cell\intbl\b\fs16 Stock\b0\cell\intbl\b\fs16 Pending current\b0\cell\intbl\b\fs16 Pending last month\b0\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\cellx7200\cellx9000\intbl\fs16 Accessorise\cell\intbl\fs16 29,190.64\cell\intbl\fs16 54,990\cell\intbl\fs16 737\cell\intbl\fs16 4,761\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\cellx7200\cellx9000\intbl\fs16 Ball Cock\cell\intbl\fs16 40,661.953\cell\intbl\fs16 28,166\cell\intbl\fs16 206\cell\intbl\fs16 21,014\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\cellx7200\cellx9000\intbl\fs16 Cabinet\cell\intbl\fs16 1,689.6702\cell\intbl\fs16 1,252\cell\intbl\fs16 41\cell\intbl\fs16 323\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\cellx7200\cellx9000\intbl\fs16 Cistern & Seat Cover\cell\intbl\fs16 26,768.67\cell\intbl\fs16 9,539\cell\intbl\fs16 295\cell\intbl\fs16 15,438\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\cellx7200\cellx9000\intbl\fs16 Cocks Premium\cell\intbl\fs16 20,216.64\cell\intbl\fs16 28,474\cell\intbl\fs16 1,861\cell\intbl\fs16 5,480\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\cellx7200\cellx9000\intbl\fs16 Cocks Standard\cell\intbl\fs16 409,324.90\cell\intbl\fs16 189,494\cell\intbl\fs16 2,028\cell\intbl\fs16 110,851\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\cellx7200\cellx9000\intbl\fs16 Faucets & Jetsprays & Shower\cell\intbl\fs16 49,984.656\cell\intbl\fs16 19,052\cell\intbl\fs16 140\cell\intbl\fs16 23,944\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\cellx7200\cellx9000\intbl\fs16 P.V.C. Connections\cell\intbl\fs16 123,799.34\cell\intbl\fs16 83,419\cell\intbl\fs16 67\cell\intbl\fs16 1,225\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\cellx7200\cellx9000\intbl\fs16 Unclassified\cell\intbl\fs16 2,750.6602\cell\intbl\fs16 4,281\cell\intbl\fs16 30\cell\intbl\fs16 737\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\cellx7200\cellx9000\intbl\fs16 Waste Pipes\cell\intbl\fs16 62,831.33\cell\intbl\fs16 58,399\cell\intbl\fs16 925\cell\intbl\fs16 6,594\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\cellx7200\cellx9000\intbl\fs16 TOTAL\cell\intbl\fs16 767,219.25\cell\intbl\fs16 477,066\cell\intbl\fs16 6,330\cell\intbl\fs16 190,367\cell\row\pard\sa80\par\pard\sa100\b\f0\fs25\cf2 A3. Which field is used for the 3-month average?\b0\par\pard\sa100\f0\fs19 The app uses the 3-month average, not the annual average. The source column is LAST 3 MONTH AVG SALE. The source workbook value is already a monthly average. The plan code stores it as a three-month total internally by multiplying by three, and computeItemPlan() divides it by three before calculating BufferReq = Avg3MoSale × multiplier. The annual field AVG SALE 25-26 is not used in the buffer term.\par\pard\sa100\b\f0\fs25\cf2 A4. Row-level clamp\b0\par\pard\sa100\f0\fs19 The app clamps production at zero per item code and colour row. Formula: max((BufferReq − Stock) + Pending Order Last Month + Pending Order, 0).\par\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\intbl\b\fs16 Measure\b0\cell\intbl\b\fs16 Value\b0\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\intbl\fs16 Total rows\cell\intbl\fs16 3,584\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\intbl\fs16 Rows with negative unclamped production\cell\intbl\fs16 959\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\intbl\fs16 Summed magnitude of negative values\cell\intbl\fs16 213,112.00\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\intbl\fs16 Negative Unclassified rows\cell\intbl\fs16 0\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\intbl\fs16 Negative classified rows\cell\intbl\fs16 959\cell\row\pard\sa80\par\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\intbl\b\fs16 Category\b0\cell\intbl\b\fs16 Negative rows\b0\cell\intbl\b\fs16 Negative magnitude\b0\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\intbl\fs16 Accessorise\cell\intbl\fs16 82\cell\intbl\fs16 42,304.40\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\intbl\fs16 Ball Cock\cell\intbl\fs16 12\cell\intbl\fs16 25,079.00\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\intbl\fs16 Cabinet\cell\intbl\fs16 22\cell\intbl\fs16 826.00\cell\row\trowd\trgaph60\cellx1800\cellx3600\cellx5400\intbl\fs16 Cistern & Seat Cover\cell\intbl\fs16 48\cell\intbl\fs16 7,282.60\cel